DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
45704::$$$message_0436_0000_0000$$$::"Hmm... I'm lost."::
45705::$$$message_0436_0000_0001$$$::"Oh? What is the matter, Ryunosuke?"::
45706::$$$message_0436_0000_0002$$$::"Big man... I was thinking about how I'd improve the orchestra."::
45707::$$$message_0436_0000_0003$$$::"Hm, hm. Violin, cello, viola, double bass... (etc.) ...harp, and timpani."::
45708::$$$message_0436_0000_0004$$$::"What a magnificent ensemble, don't you think? You've grown, Ryunosuke... As your Servant, I consider this an unexpected joy."::
45709::$$$message_0436_0000_0005$$$::"Hehe. Thanks, man."::
45710::$$$message_0436_0000_0006$$$::"Still... If we're going to build something of that scale, we're way short on parts."::
45711::$$$message_0436_0000_0007$$$::"Indeed... This atelier also lacks space for us to work in."::
45712::$$$message_0436_0000_0008$$$::"They'd all be past their expiration dates by the time we finish building them all one at a time, too... This is a real pickle."::
45713::$$$message_0436_0000_0009$$$::"Think hard on it, Ryunosuke. Many artists since antiquity have made sudden breakthroughs after overcoming such creative blocks."::
45714::$$$message_0436_0000_0010$$$::"Yes, if you can overcome this, I believe you will stare even deeper into the abyss of beauty!"::
45715::$$$message_0436_0000_0011$$$::"Yeah! I won't give up!"::
45716::$$$message_0436_0000_0012$$$::"That aside, Ryunosuke, I found this by the entrance..."::
45717::$$$message_0436_0000_0013$$$::"Oh, thanks. What's this? An invitation...?"::
45718::$$$message_0436_0000_0014$$$::"An invitation... To a ball of some kind?"::
45719::$$$message_0436_0000_0015$$$::"No, it looks like it's for an onsen...a magical onsen that grants any wish."::
45720::$$$message_0436_0000_0016$$$::"...What? Any wish, you say?"::
45721::$$$message_0436_0000_0017$$$::"Yeah. It says, 'Also, only the first two visitors' wishes will be granted. Get your butts over here; actually, just drop dead, you troublemakers.'"::
45722::$$$message_0436_0000_0018$$$::"Ryunosuke this is..."::
45723::$$$message_0436_0000_0019$$$::"Yeah, this is..."::
45724::$$$message_0436_0000_0020$$$::"Something we must attend!"::
45725::$$$message_0436_0000_0021$$$::"A place we gotta go, big man!"::

